From 8030fabf82c8c307337cfcfae48c3f9fbbe5ebd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zed-patches <zed-patches@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:13:42 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_servers: Zeo's skills reach Claude Agent (Plus) as
 plugins
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Zeo proposal §6.69 step 2 (operator, 2026-11-22). Zeo's skills live in
~/.agents/skills and <project>/.agents/skills, which only the native Zed
agent reads: the Claude CLI does not (the plus lane measured it on CLI
2.1.325: the path occurs only in its Cursor importer, and a probe's
supportedCommands() did not list skills placed there). The SDK's `skills`
option only filters what is loaded; its `plugins` option loads a local
directory, and a manifest-less directory whose `skills` is a symlink loads
that folder's skills under the directory's name (measured by the same probe).

So Zeo keeps one such directory per source under its data dir
(agent-skill-plugins/zeo-agents-skills -> ~/.agents/skills, and
agent-skill-plugins/projects/<fnv of the root>/zeo-project-skills ->
<root>/.agents/skills), made or re-pointed when a session starts and only
for a folder that exists, and sends them in session/new, session/load and
session/resume as _meta.claudeCode.options.plugins = [{type: "local",
path}], which Plus spreads into the SDK options (acp-agent.ts, unchanged
keys). Only Zeo's two Claude adapters get it (Plus; the TUI adapter, which
may ignore it). Nothing is copied. Skills then show as
zeo-agents-skills:<name> and zeo-project-skills:<name>. Not on Windows: the
plugin directory is a symlink.

Code: agent_servers::zeo_skills_plugin (new); acp::session_meta::
new_session_meta wraps session_request_meta; the five request sites in
acp/v1.rs and acp/v2.rs call it (one line each). agent_servers gains
`paths` as a normal dependency (it was a dev-dependency; Cargo.lock
unchanged). A jailed agent sees the project; the plugin root and
~/.agents/skills are mapped read-only by the agent sandbox (0146).

Tests zeo_skills_plugin::zeo_skills_plugin_tests (new): both folders linked
and reached through the plugin, the same directories next time, missing
folders give no plugin, a stale link re-pointed, the meta is the SDK's local
plugin list, only Zeo's Claude adapters. Red seen with the functions
neutralized.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
